      Code:
      ${selectedSubmission.code}

      Generate a pixel-perfect, fully-functional HTML/CSS/JS snippet that perfectly simulates this visual interface.
      Make it modern, responsive, and EXACTLY ditto to what the native application looks and behaves like.
      Embed assets as base64 if needed.
      Return ONLY the raw HTML code. Do NOT wrap it in markdown backticks. Return nothing else.`;

      let result = await callGroq(prompt);
      result = result
        .replace(/```[a-zA-Z]*\n?/g, "")
        .replace(/```/g, "")
        .trim();

